      § 217-7
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7682766"
    >
Effective date.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7682766" data-guid="7682766"></div>
        <div id="questions-7682766" data-guid="7682766" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7682766_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="history">[Amended <span class="legref" data-ref=""><span class="hisdate">1-22-2009</span> by <span class="loclaw">Ord. No. 24.41.08</span></span>]</div><div class="para">Section <a class="xref" guid="13122049" href="13122049#13122049">217-3B(4)</a> shall take effect February 1, 2009. Section <a class="xref" guid="13122050" href="13122050#13122050">217-3D</a> shall take effect October 1, 2009, and shall cease to have force and effect after December 31, 2011. All other such amendments shall take effect immediately upon passage.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

